+/* ---------------- Expirations (Phase 3.1 #4) — everything that lapses, in one ranked list ----------------
+   DB layer: sql/expirations_2026-10-18.sql (applied, RETEST 25/0/2). Reads dept_expirations() (Board/DA/Officer) and
